Bumps adlfs from 2024.2.0 to 2024.4.1.

Release notes
Sourced from adlfs's releases.

2024.4.1
What's Changed

Honor the anon parameter if set by @​adam-roughton in fsspec/adlfs#468

New Contributors

@​adam-roughton made their first contribution in fsspec/adlfs#468

Full Changelog: fsspec/[email removed]...2024.4.1
2024.4.0
What's Changed

add missing await on delete_blob call per issue 459 by @​johnmacnamararseg in fsspec/adlfs#460
format via black and add installation of dev deps to contributing docs by @​johnmacnamararseg in fsspec/adlfs#464
Make AzureBlobFileSystem anon behaviour configurable via env var. by @​microft in fsspec/adlfs#437
document that credential needs to be from azure.identity.aio by @​temporaer in fsspec/adlfs#463

New Contributors

@​johnmacnamararseg made their first contribution in fsspec/adlfs#460
@​microft made their first contribution in fsspec/adlfs#437
